---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Managed Web Services">
    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-16 px-6">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-black mb-8">Managed Web Services</h1>
        <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg">
            <p>Technology should empower, not distract. Our managed services handle hosting, security, performance, and updates, ensuring your digital storefront remains a reliable, high-converting revenue driver.</p>
            <h3>End-to-end oversight:</h3>
            <ul class="list-disc ml-6 space-y-2">
                <li><strong>24/7 Monitoring</strong>: Proactive oversight of your uptime and server health.</li>
                <li><strong>Enterprise-Grade Security</strong>: Hardened firewalls and regular security patches.</li>
                <li><strong>Optimization & Speed</strong>: Continuous performance tuning to keep you ranking high in search results.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-16 bg-slate-900 p-10 rounded-3xl border border-slate-700">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-6 text-center">PI-HUB Design Concept Preview</h3>
            <div class="h-64 bg-slate-800 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-dashed border-slate-600">
                <span class="text-slate-500 font-black text-2xl">PI-HUB // DESIGN CONCEPT V.01</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>
